  "title": "Oshkosh Corporation Advances Job Site of the Future Vision with Strategic Equity Investment in Nextera Robotics",
  "summary": "Oshkosh Corporation (NYSE: OSK), a global industrial technology company that develops purpose-built vehicles, equipment and services, today announced a strategic equity investment in Nextera Robotics, an artificial intelligence (AI) and robotics company developing autonomous technologies for construction project management and job site intelligence.",
